{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16918","headline":"元和癸巳余领蜀之七年奉诏徴还二月二十八日清明途经百牢关因题石门洞 · 武元衡","name":"元和癸巳余领蜀之七年奉诏徴还二月二十八日清明途经百牢关因题石门洞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔佩兵符去，今持相印还。\n天光临井络，春物度巴山。\n鸟道青冥外，风泉洞壑间。\n何慙班定远，辛苦玉门关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}